          "c": "唔該，埋單。",
          "j": "m4 goi1, maai4 daan1.",
          "e": "Excuse me, the bill please.",
          "note": "埋單 (maai4 daan1) is \"the bill, please / let's pay\" — the all-important phrase at the end of a meal. (Often Mandarinised elsewhere as \"mai dan\", but in Cantonese it's 埋單 maai4 daan1.)",
          "bd": [
