          "c": "呢個好食！",
          "j": "ni1 go3 hou2 sik6!",
          "e": "This is delicious!",
          "note": "好食 (hou2 sik6), literally \"good-to-eat\", means \"delicious\". It's part of a family: 好食 (hou2 sik6) tasty, 好飲 (hou2 jam2) nice to drink, 好睇 (hou2 tai2) nice to watch — 好 (hou2) + a verb = \"nice to ___\".",
